25	 * announced household, not a suspected duplicate. The flag is left false for such owners.
26	 *
27	 * <p>Runs after the owner's fields are finalized and before {@link SaveOwner}, so the comparison is
28	 * against every already-persisted owner and the new owner (not yet saved) is excluded. When several
29	 * existing owners match, the one with the smallest id wins, so the result is deterministic.
30	 */
